    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "you said those arguments aren't rooted in empirical data, but what about the studies that show DEI can actually lead to groupthink or lower performance in certain team settings? some analysts are saying the correlation between diversity and profit is actually pretty weak when you control for other factors. isn't it fair to say that the 'consensus' you mentioned is actually a lot more divided than you're making it sound?",
